# B014: frozen eta=.1 trajectory endpoint comparison with a support-aware exact baseline

Source recovery fixed the prior B15 commit and recovered the exact eta=.1 output.
The raw reference has205 post-growth queries,100 post-growth refreshes, and71 late
refreshes at t>=125. First reconstruct the exact cached-Gram policy on the current
pinned Landmark first512 rows and require bit-identical query/update masks to the
recovered exact B15 NPZ. If either mask differs or there are not exactly71 late
refreshes, preserve the mismatch and do not evaluate replacement endpoints.

At the71 frozen late refresh prefixes compare three endpoint routines, each in
three paired repeats/seeds: (a) full dense exact SVD, matching B15; (b) a strong
simple exact SVD restricted to the incrementally known nonzero columns; and (c)
the selected Block Krylov q=1,width35 with fixed Gaussian seeds101,102,103. The
active-column set is derivable online and frozen before endpoint timing; the
support-restricted matrix slice/copy remains inside its endpoint timer. Block
Krylov uses a fixed full-dimension Omega per seed and counts four matrix passes.
No warm start or parameter tuning is added.

For every Block Krylov endpoint use an independently computed full exact SVD truth.
Require Frobenius ratio<=1+1e-8, spectral ratio<=1+1e-6, and the frozen B15 strict
objective excess<=1e-10*max(1,prefix energy). Preserve all213 endpoint rows and
all timings. Evaluation and exact-policy reconstruction costs are reported
separately from endpoint solver time; total task time is also retained.

Predictions: the recovered masks reproduce because the same author raw rows are
used; Block Krylov passes quality because every512-prefix row has support within65
columns. It may beat the old full dense exact SVD, but the support-aware exact SVD
is the decisive simple baseline. If Block Krylov fails any quality gate, do not
integrate it. If it passes but is not faster than support-aware exact in every
paired total (with medians also reported), reject a practical speed claim and
retire this endpoint direction. Only if it passes quality and beats both exact
baselines in every paired total may a separately planned full-policy timing test
proceed. One correlated trajectory is development evidence, not generalization or
novelty.

CPU one thread via cpu_guard,4GiB address-space cap, timeout300s, expected peak
below500MiB. No native5000 expansion is authorized by this plan.
